[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3 uid="uid://unitcoinglow"]

; An additive, unshaded, billboarded QuadMesh with a radial GradientTexture2D:
; the halo must read as a soft gold ring against the dark ground, independent of
; any sky. The metallic + emissive body beside it needs a skybox to reflect, so
; it reads dark here.

